<view class="report-page safe-bottom"><view class="report-header"><view class="back-button" bindtap="back">‹</view><text class="page-title">测评结果报告</text></view><view class="card patient-card"><view class="avatar">{{patient.initial}}</view><view><view class="patient-name">{{patient.name}}</view><view class="patient-meta">{{patient.genderLabel}}　{{patient.ageLabel}}　编号：{{patient.patientCode}}</view></view></view><view class="card overview-card"><view class="section-title">六项测评结果</view><view wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="scaleCode" class="result-row"><view><view class="result-code">{{item.scaleCode}}</view><view class="result-time">用时 {{item.durationText}}</view></view><view class="result-score">{{item.scoreText}}</view><view class="result-label {{item.abnormal ? 'abnormal' : ''}}">{{item.label}}</view></view></view><view class="card radar-card"><view class="section-title">六维能力图</view><canvas id="radar" type="2d" class="radar"></canvas><view class="radar-note">根据六项测评最新成绩标准化展示</view></view><view class="card advice-card"><view class="section-title">医生建议</view><view class="advice">请结合患者实际访谈、既往病史、受教育程度和本次六项测评结果，由医生填写专业建议。系统不会自动生成或替代医生意见。</view></view><button class="primary-button" bindtap="download">导出综合报告</button></view>
